==Battleground==
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Iguanidae Ibilujon]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 61.33 seconds<sup>1,840f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 62 seconds<sup>1,860f</sup>, delay 93.33~96.67 seconds<sup>2,800f~2,900f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

